  "standardSubstitutions": [
    "Existing ResolverOracle standard allocation, memory, libc++ string and static guard providers.",
    "Original standard snprintf format/varargs are forwarded to system libc snprintf; no proprietary selection or URI formatting branch is substituted.",
    "Collector cases supply explicit already-selected URI values through the original image provider virtual+0x18. Original rank order, URI equality deduplication, readiness and finalizer execute unchanged.",
    "Default-image cases supply standard native protobuf ImageGroup/Image and Album-view storage. Original Album provider and size matching execute unchanged, then the exact original URI-to-packed-default-slot slice and original packed rank-zero URI reader execute. No Dart algorithm supplies expected IDs/URIs."
  ],
  "observedPrintfFormats": [
    "%s",
    ":%s",
    "spotify:image:%s"
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Inputs are synthetic already-admitted, ordered image components; playlist source admission, source order, visual trait policy and metadata acquisition remain explicit caller context.",
    "Track normal image path reads Album.cover_group only; first matching effective Image.size0 must have exactly20-bytefile_id. Legacy cover-only and nonnormal source strategies are not inferred.",
    "Original playlist caller uses grid dimension2 and stops at4 distinct admitted image URIs; selector cases above4 characterize the helper only.",
    "No HTTP, app/profile/cache access, original identities or image payloads are involved."
  ],
